Package: FLOSS
Type: Package
Title: FL Operating Model and Sampling Simulator
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Henning", "Winker", email = "henning.winker@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Builds multi-fleet, multi-species age-structured operating models
    from life-history parameters, fleet selectivity, relative catchability and
    a target MSY, driven by shared fleet effort (with optional effort creep),
    and generates the data such fisheries produce (catch, effort, CPUE, survey
    indices, length frequencies and biological samples). Designed for training
    and for trainers who need realistic example datasets with a known truth.
    Built on FLR ('FLCore', 'FLBRP', 'FLasher', 'FLife') and 'FLRef'.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
